      "artist": "Mick Garratt",
      "description": "3D map of Helmsley Castle The start of the visitor walk around Helmsley Castle. The 3D map has a Braille legend and the orange blob indicates where you are. The map is correctly orientated so that the path ahead with footbridge can be seen on the map to the right of the rampart from the blob. Not sure if I've made myself clear there. A slight problem is that the official route is clockwise so it's the returning trip along this path. This fact wasn't discovered until we tried to make sense of the ruins.",
